OL,3,ATrump, Xi and Putin set to hold
OL,4,Ahistoric meeting on Apec sidelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said AI
OL,7,Fis "almost completely good" in his
OL,8,Fopening remarks at the plenary session
OL,9,Fof the Asia-Pacific Economic
OL,10,FCo-operation (Apec) summit in the
OL,11,Fsouthern Chinese city of Shenzhen
OL,13,FChina's Xi Jinping, who spoke just
OL,14,Fbefore Trump, has pledged $20m to
OL,15,Fpromote Asia-Pacific co-operation
OL,17,FTrump, Xi and Russia's Vladimir Putin
OL,18,Fare due to hold three-way talks later -
OL,19,Fthe first time the leaders of these
OL,20,Fcountries have held a formal meeting;
OL,21,Fread how the meeting is an opportunity
OL,22,Ffor the Chinese leader to exude power
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
