OL,3,ATrump, Xi and Putin set to hold
OL,4,Ahistoric meeting on Apec sidelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FTopics thought to be on the agenda
OL,7,Finclude the wars in Ukraine and Iran,
OL,8,Fnuclear proliferation, trade tensions
OL,9,Fand developments in artificial
OL,10,Fintelligence
OL,12,FTrump is also due to hold a bilateral
OL,13,Fmeeting with Putin on Thursday
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
